1
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:07,801
得 您待着 我-我来接
Okay. I'll -- I'll get that.

2
00:00:08,897 --> 00:00:09,420
喂
Hello?

3
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:11,009
喂 曼尼正在准备
Hey, Manny's getting his outfit together

4
00:00:11,009 --> 00:00:12,427
他今晚舞会的行头
for the dance tonight.

5
00:00:12,427 --> 00:00:14,690
我正在把舞会用品往车上装呢
I was just taking some supplies out to the car.

6
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,822
太激动了 小伙子们的第一次舞会耶
Isn't this exciting -- the boys' first dance?

7
00:00:16,842 --> 00:00:18,030
简直是我人生中最美好的一天
Greatest day of my life.

8
00:00:18,049 --> 00:00:20,081
话说菲尔有绿色的装饰方巾不
Does Phil have a green pocket square for him?

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:21,420
青色
Teal!

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:22,700
好吧 青色的
Teal.

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,960
我不知道 不过我不觉得菲尔是个
I don't know. I don't think Phil's

12
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,420
会往西服口袋里搞什么装饰方巾的人哎
really a pocket-square kind of a guy.

13
00:00:29,283 --> 00:00:31,194
咱还是问问米奇吧
Why don't we conference in Mitch?

14
00:00:31,466 --> 00:00:33,336
看 介个玩意儿行不
Ay! Look. This might work.

15
00:00:33,346 --> 00:00:35,549
这是蓝绿色的诶...
Well, except that it's turquoise...

16
00:00:35,991 --> 00:00:36,403
还是个胸罩
oh, and a bra?!

17
00:00:36,403 --> 00:00:40,004
你觉得俺们村儿里的孩子会戴装饰方巾吗
Do you think the kids in my village had pocket squares?

18
00:00:40,024 --> 00:00:42,086
又扯什么你们村儿
Here we go with the village.

19
00:00:42,106 --> 00:00:44,540
-爸 还在听不 -很不幸 我还在
- Dad, are you still there? - Unfortunately, yes.

20
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,606
帮我问下克莱尔
Please ask Claire what time

21
00:00:45,606 --> 00:00:47,477
我该几点去学校帮忙啊
do I need to be at the school to help set up.

22
00:00:47,487 --> 00:00:48,604
歌洛莉亚想问--
Gloria wants to know --

23
00:00:48,613 --> 00:00:49,911
不用重复 我听着了 听着了
No, I heard. I heard.

24
00:00:49,921 --> 00:00:51,832
告诉她很感谢她这么热心
Um, tell her thank you so much,

25
00:00:51,832 --> 00:00:54,165
但我们的人手已经足够了
but we have all the help we could possibly need,

26
00:00:54,165 --> 00:00:55,643
其实如果她不想来的话
and she doesn't even have to come tonight

27
00:00:55,663 --> 00:00:57,081
-她压根儿都不用出现 -克莱尔说
- if she doesn't want to. - Claire said --

28
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:58,300
我听见了
I heard.

29
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:00,974
喂
Hello?

30
00:01:00,974 --> 00:01:01,990
喂 米奇
Oh, hey, Mitch!

31
00:01:01,999 --> 00:01:04,061
-你在哪儿 -我们在公园呢
- Where are you? - Oh, we're at the park.

32
00:01:04,061 --> 00:01:04,695
你肯定不敢相信
You would not believe

33
00:01:04,695 --> 00:01:06,435
某些家长是怎么打扮自己孩子的
how some of these people dress their kids.

34
00:01:06,465 --> 00:01:08,154
莉莉的小伙伴刚刚从沙坑玩具车里
Lily's friend just pulled a Britney Spears

35
00:01:08,154 --> 00:01:09,432
拽出一个迷你版布兰妮
getting out of a sandbox car.

36
00:01:09,452 --> 00:01:11,111
老爸也在听着呢
So, dad's on the line.

37
00:01:11,131 --> 00:01:13,867
你那儿有没有青色的装饰方巾啊 曼尼要用
Do you he a teal pocket square for Manny?

38
00:01:13,877 --> 00:01:15,959
小卡 曼尼想问你借青色的装饰方巾
Cam, Manny needs a teal pocket square.

39
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:18,171
我有青色的 水蓝色的 浅蓝色的
Oh, I've got teal, I've got aqua, i've got sea foam...

40
00:01:18,171 --> 00:01:20,314
-小卡啥都有 -小卡有
- Yeah, Cam's got one. - Cam's got one.

41
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,120
太棒了
Yes!

42
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:23,100
我想起来了 我借给安德瑞了
Oh, you know what? I lent it to Andre.

43
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,820
不过他借给安德瑞了
Ah. He lent it to Andre.

44
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:25,660
情况有变
Flag on the play.

45
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:26,740
你说啥
What's that mean?

46
00:01:26,831 --> 00:01:27,347
啥意思
What's that mean?!

47
00:01:27,347 --> 00:01:31,236
看来我得去趟商场了
Now I got to go to the mall.

48
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:32,900
这身怎么样
Is this okay?

49
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,560
太巧了 卢克也要去商场耶
Oh, hey! Luke has to go to the mall, too.

50
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:37,380
为啥
What?

51
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,220
菲尔
Phil.

52
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:40,880
咱走吧 绿巨人
Let's go, Incredible Hulk.

53
00:01:57,505 --> 00:01:59,638
那个叫莉莉小姑娘是你家的不
Uh, is that ur little girl over there -- Lily?

54
00:01:59,668 --> 00:02:01,478
-是啊 看她多可爱 -是啊
- Yes. Look at her. - Yes.

55
00:02:01,508 --> 00:02:02,785
这事说起来有点尴尬
Uh, well, this is a little bit awkward,

56
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,460
不过她刚刚咬了我家泰勒
but she bit Tyler.

57
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,160
不是吧
Oh, no.

58
00:02:06,326 --> 00:02:07,140
我的老天爷
Oh, my goodness.

59
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,081
我真不知道该说什么好
I -- I don't even know what to say.

60
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:10,760
她从没这么干过
She's never done anything like that before.

61
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:11,660
到底怎么回事
How did it happen?

62
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:12,900
我也不知道 我没看见
I don't know. I didn't see.

63
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,780
大家都爱来这套
It's time to play everyone's favorite game.

64
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:19,060
"都怪基佬爸爸"
"Let's blame the gay dads"!

65
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,380
你知道异性恋都生出什么货色吗
You know who had straight parents?

66
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:21,240
希特勒
Adolf Hitler.

67
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,140
杀人狂曼森
Charles Manson.

68
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:23,660
-咱还继续不 -爱打人的超模娜奥米
- Shall we go on? - Naomi Campbell.

69
00:02:24,499 --> 00:02:25,948
但我知道肯定有这么回事
I-I know it happened.

70
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,060
他胳膊上还有牙印呢
He's got bite marks on his arm.

71
00:02:29,206 --> 00:02:32,203
老天 还真有人咬你了哈
Oh, gosh, someone really sunk their teeth into you, huh?

72
00:02:32,203 --> 00:02:34,003
你真是个可口的小家伙
It's 'cause you're such a yummy little guy!

73
00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:34,620
是啊
Yes!

74
00:02:35,380 --> 00:02:36,780
才不是我家闺女干的呢
Our daughter didn't do that.

75
00:02:37,071 --> 00:02:38,740
-但是他说 -好吧
- But he said -- - Right.

76
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:39,978
没准儿是他搞错了
He's probably just confused.

77
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:41,360
你猜我认为是谁干的
You know who I bet did it, though?

78
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:43,180
是比利 念起来和莉莉差不多
Billy. Rhymes with Lily.

79
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,700
而且 他可好斗了
Plus, he is very aggressive.

80
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,500
他家保姆就在那儿呢
His babysitter's right over there.

81
00:02:46,615 --> 00:02:49,622
她 她不太会管孩子
She's -- she's not much of a disciplinarian.

82
00:02:49,642 --> 00:02:50,920
我可以跟你保证
Because I can assure you,

83
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:52,277
要是我家闺女咬人了
if our child did something like this,

84
00:02:52,277 --> 00:02:54,379
我们肯定会寸步不离地看着她
we would be on her like white on rice.

85
00:02:54,379 --> 00:02:56,763
我知道这听起来貌似有点种族歧视
And I know that sounds a little bit like a racial slur,

86
00:02:56,763 --> 00:02:58,835
因为我们是白人 而她八成爱吃米饭
because we're white and she presumably likes rice,

87
00:02:58,845 --> 00:03:00,896
不过我真不是故意说成这样的
but I didn't intend it that way.

88
00:03:02,465 --> 00:03:06,468
终于有车位了
Ah. Finally. There's a spot.

89
00:03:06,498 --> 00:03:09,033
小伙子们 我现在好为你们骄傲
Guys, I am just bursting with pride right now.

90
00:03:09,033 --> 00:03:10,591
这可是你们第一次舞会啊
Your first dance.

91
00:03:10,591 --> 00:03:12,170
很快你们也成男子汉了
Soon you're gonna be men.

92
00:03:12,442 --> 00:03:13,850
你们得知道 男子汉可不会
I want you to know there's more to be a man

93
00:03:13,850 --> 00:03:15,590
整天想着买漂亮衣服
than just shopping for fancy outfits.

94
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,541
没错 很快你们就要长出胸毛
Yep. Pretty soon, you get some hair on your chest,

95
00:03:17,541 --> 00:03:18,446
接电话时
you start answering the phone,

96
00:03:18,446 --> 00:03:20,076
人家也不会以为你们是女人了
people don't think you're ladies.

97
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:22,740
别磨叽了 戴茜小姐
Come on, today, Miss Daisy.

98
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,660
事实上 戴茜小姐是坐车的
Actually, Miss Daisy was the one being driven,

99
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,660
不是开车的
not the one driving.

100
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,620
没看过
Never saw it.

101
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,140
那片儿叫《为戴茜小姐开车》
It's called "Driving Miss Daisy".

102
00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:31,480
我说你今天话挺多啊
You got a real lip on you today. You know that?

103
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,320
喂 那是我们的车位
Hey! That was our spot!

104
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:39,780
你在干啥啊
What are you doing?

105
00:03:40,824 --> 00:03:42,293
你就这么把车位拱手让人了啊
You're gonna let him snake your spot?

106
00:03:42,302 --> 00:03:43,751
没啥大不了的
Not worth it.

107
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,520
孩子们 要想当男子汉
Boys, here's the only thing you got to know

108
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,487
你们必须得记住
about being a man --

109
00:03:46,496 --> 00:03:48,296
永远不能让别人抢走你的东西
never let someone take what is yours.

110
00:03:48,306 --> 00:03:49,836
除非那只是个微不足道的小车位
Unless it's just a parking spot

111
00:03:49,855 --> 00:03:51,313
车位多的是嘛
and there's plenty of others.

112
00:03:51,333 --> 00:03:53,496
好贴心哦 菲尔 真该把这写下来
That's sweet, Phil. You ought to write that down.

113
00:03:53,516 --> 00:03:56,010
你包里肯定还带着口红呢吧 娘娘腔
You got any lipstick in your purse?

114
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,790
你开玩笑吗 我很爱杰的
I love Jay. Are you kidding me?

115
00:03:57,810 --> 00:03:59,018
他是我的哥们
He's my boy.

116
00:03:59,027 --> 00:04:00,445
当然 他经常和我过不去
Yeah, he gives me a hard time,

117
00:04:00,455 --> 00:04:02,135
可这就是和岳父的相处之道
but that's the deal with a father-in-law.

118
00:04:02,135 --> 00:04:04,438
关键在于
The key is,

119
00:04:04,438 --> 00:04:07,133
我绝不向他妥协
I never let him see just how much it devastates me.

120
00:04:07,174 --> 00:04:08,110
这念"邓菲"
It's "Dunphy."

121
00:04:08,129 --> 00:04:09,337
我就这么念的 "傻菲"
That's what I said -- "Dumphy."

122
00:04:09,346 --> 00:04:10,473
不对 不是"傻"
No, not "dumb".

123
00:04:10,493 --> 00:04:11,719
是"邓菲"
"Dunphy".

124
00:04:11,719 --> 00:04:12,706
"傻菲"
"Dumphy".

125
00:04:12,725 --> 00:04:13,923
-跟我念"邓" -邓
- Say "done". - Done.

126
00:04:13,952 --> 00:04:15,482
-跟我念"菲" -菲
- Say "fee". - Fee.

127
00:04:15,491 --> 00:04:17,452
-"邓菲" -"傻菲"
- "Done-fee". - "Dumphy".

128
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:20,560
好的 往这边挪点
All right, just bring it this way?

129
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:21,520
这边 就这了
This way -- there it is.

130
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:23,160
很好 谢谢 很完美
Perfect. Thank you. Perfect.

131
00:04:24,251 --> 00:04:25,729
克莱 克莱尔
Cla-a-aire?

132
00:04:25,739 --> 00:04:27,751
-怎么了 -你能让格斯去修一下那盏灯吗
- What? - Can you ask Gus to fix that light?

133
00:04:27,751 --> 00:04:29,762
我刚去请他帮忙 他却对着我大声咆哮
I asked him, but he just growled at me.

134
00:04:29,762 --> 00:04:31,100
噢 天呐 好吧
Oh, gosh. Okay.

135
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:33,986
格斯 别吓唬贝瑟妮了 请你快去把灯修了吧
Gus, stop scaring Bethenny and fix the light, please?

136
00:04:34,016 --> 00:04:35,515
别逼我
Don't make me come over there.

137
00:04:35,525 --> 00:04:37,687
我忙得很呢 要修自己去修吧
I'm busy. You fix it.

138
00:04:37,707 --> 00:04:39,407
你这样是不是就因为
Is this because I said

139
00:04:39,407 --> 00:04:41,479
我不肯跟你一起跳舞
i wouldn't come to the dance with you?

140
00:04:41,479 --> 00:04:43,661
格斯 我已为人妻了 别人会说闲话的
Gus, I'm a married woman. People would talk.

141
00:04:43,661 --> 00:04:46,316
只要和我销魂一舞 保证你忘乎所以
One dance with me, you'd forget all about him.

142
00:04:46,316 --> 00:04:49,082
好吧 有一个不肯修灯的老公已经够让我受的了
Yeah, I already have a husband who doesn't fix lights.

143
00:04:49,082 --> 00:04:50,230
求你了
Please?

144
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,120
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

145
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,920
你简直就是这所学校的顶梁柱
This school would literally fall apart without you.

146
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,480
还说不上"顶梁柱"啦 可
Well, I don't know about "literally"，but...

147
00:04:58,747 --> 00:05:01,352
大家好 我来咯
Ihola, hola! I'm here!

148
00:05:01,372 --> 00:05:03,454
噢 你还是来了
Oh, you came anyway.

149
00:05:03,464 --> 00:05:04,461
太好了
That's great.

150
00:05:04,470 --> 00:05:06,149
我感觉也很好
I think it's great, too.

151
00:05:06,149 --> 00:05:07,628
几周前 校方在征集
A few weeks ago, they asked for someone

152
00:05:07,628 --> 00:05:09,529
愿意负责这次舞会的人
to be in charge of the school dance,

153
00:05:09,529 --> 00:05:10,886
我报名了
and I volunteered.

154
00:05:10,886 --> 00:05:12,465
学校这次召集志愿者
The school asks for volunteers

155
00:05:12,475 --> 00:05:14,507
就是为了能让所有人参与其中
so that everybody will feel included,

156
00:05:14,527 --> 00:05:16,187
可他们在开什么国际大玩笑
but who are they kidding?

157
00:05:16,207 --> 00:05:17,797
我才是这项工作的不二人选
They want me to do it.

158
00:05:17,816 --> 00:05:20,018
自从海莉十二岁开始 学校里所有的舞会都是我负责的
I've put on every school dance since Haley was 12.

159
00:05:20,028 --> 00:05:21,156
这是我的专长
It's my thing.

160
00:05:21,165 --> 00:05:23,357
校方让我们当联席主席
They made us co-chairs,

161
00:05:23,357 --> 00:05:26,023
就是为了让我们合作
which means we're supposed to do everything together,

162
00:05:26,033 --> 00:05:29,341
可克莱尔从不接受我的建议
but Claire won't take any of my ideas.

163
00:05:29,362 --> 00:05:32,831
她居然提议"天方夜谭"为舞会主题
She suggested an "Arabian nights" theme.

164
00:05:33,324 --> 00:05:35,517
对小孩子来说是不是太早了
Isn't it a little soon?

165
00:05:35,517 --> 00:05:37,417
好吧 大伙注意了
Okay. Um, hey, everybody?

166
00:05:37,448 --> 00:05:39,660
你们认识歌洛莉亚吗 曼尼的母亲
Do you know Gloria, Manny's mom?

167
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:41,360
她是来帮我们忙的
She's here to help us out today.

168
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:42,457
我是联席主席
I'm the co-chair.

169
00:05:44,357 --> 00:05:45,554
两个小时以后孩子们就到了
So, the kids are gonna be here in two hours,

170
00:05:45,554 --> 00:05:47,867
大伙赶紧工作吧
so everybody back to work.

171
00:05:47,887 --> 00:05:49,477
大伙赶紧工作吧
Everybody back to work.

172
00:05:49,496 --> 00:05:50,734
这话我说过了
I just said that.

173
00:05:50,753 --> 00:05:52,704
我这是在"联说"
And I just co-said it.

174
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:56,740
那女士居然厚颜无耻的来指责莉莉
I mean, the nerve of that lady accusing Lily?

175
00:05:58,457 --> 00:05:59,704
江山易改 本性难移 小卡
Mm. Well, you know what? You can't change people, Cam.

176
00:05:59,704 --> 00:06:01,867
我们只能尽量不去受他们影响
I mean, we just have to rise above.

177
00:06:03,265 --> 00:06:04,381
怎么了
What happened?

178
00:06:04,381 --> 00:06:05,488
她咬了我一口
She bit me.

179
00:06:05,497 --> 00:06:06,946
你说真的吗
Are you serious?

180
00:06:06,976 --> 00:06:09,279
她又咬我了
Ohh! Ah! She did it again!

181
00:06:09,289 --> 00:06:11,763
这简直就是《暮光之城》
It's like "Twilight" back here!

182
00:06:12,427 --> 00:06:14,800
不行 没有雪糕吃 比利
No! No ice cream for you, Billy,

183
00:06:14,810 --> 00:06:16,681
因为那个阿姨说你到处咬人
because the lady say you biting!

184
00:06:17,304 --> 00:06:18,863
好吧 快走 快走
Okay. Okay. Go. Go.

185
00:06:18,863 --> 00:06:20,070
-好的 -快 快 快
- Yeah. - Go, go, go.

186
00:06:20,070 --> 00:06:21,499
快开车
Drive.

187
00:06:24,958 --> 00:06:26,407
你确定这个是青色吗
Are you sure this is teal?

188
00:06:26,426 --> 00:06:28,931
因为我开始觉得这个有点偏绿色
'Cause I'm starting to get a real strong green thing here.

189
00:06:28,931 --> 00:06:30,721
那是日光灯的反射效果
That's the fluorescent lights.

190
00:06:30,731 --> 00:06:33,084
我可以把这个拿到灯光明亮点的地方看看吗
Do you mind if I walk this over to lamps galore?

191
00:06:33,084 --> 00:06:35,186
你别老担心这个了
I need you to worry about this less.

192
00:06:35,196 --> 00:06:36,735
猜猜谁正好能穿下人体模特身上的衣服
Guess who fit into the suit on the mannequin

193
00:06:36,735 --> 00:06:38,525
还给我们打了八折
and saved us 20%?

194
00:06:38,565 --> 00:06:40,889
我一直不明白 人体模特
Here's something I didn't know about mannequins --

195
00:06:40,889 --> 00:06:42,236
怎么就没有"香肠"呢
they don't have a wiener.

196
00:06:42,236 --> 00:06:43,554
那是什么鬼东西
What the heck is that?

197
00:06:43,554 --> 00:06:45,505
那是"小鸡鸡"的婉转说法
It's a nicer word for "penis".

198
00:06:45,525 --> 00:06:47,657
不是 我是说 这是什么鬼东西
No, I mean, what the heck is this?

199
00:06:47,667 --> 00:06:48,463
领带啊
It's a tie.

200
00:06:48,472 --> 00:06:49,298
可这是青色的
It's teal.

201
00:06:49,317 --> 00:06:50,424
那又怎样
I don't care.

202
00:06:50,453 --> 00:06:51,902
我第一眼看见就拿了
I just grabbed the first one I saw.

203
00:06:51,932 --> 00:06:53,159
去拿个别的
Well, grab a different one.

204
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,325
不要
No!

205
00:06:54,325 --> 00:06:55,503
我现在喜欢上它了
Now I like it.

206
00:06:56,387 --> 00:06:58,529
我们先到的 别插队
Uh, I think we were here first.

207
00:06:58,529 --> 00:07:00,812
我只买一样东西 我赶时间
I just have one thing. I'm in a big rush.

208
00:07:00,812 --> 00:07:01,436
我们也赶时间
So are we.

209
00:07:01,436 --> 00:07:03,357
没关系 你先结账吧
That's fine. Go ahead.

210
00:07:03,357 --> 00:07:04,010
你搞什么
Seriously?

211
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:05,218
杰 这没什么大不了的
Jay, it's not a big deal.

212
00:07:05,237 --> 00:07:06,526
你能帮我查一下
And can you give me the sale prices

213
00:07:06,545 --> 00:07:07,833
上周我买的那些东西的价格嘛
for some things I bought last week?

214
00:07:07,852 --> 00:07:09,089
噢 我滴神呐
Oh, for god's sake!

215
00:07:09,089 --> 00:07:10,538
正如我说的那样
Now, this is what i'm talking about, boys.

216
00:07:10,538 --> 00:07:12,599
做人要强硬 不然别人会得寸进尺
You give people an inch, they'll run all over you.

217
00:07:12,599 --> 00:07:14,631
或者你也可以做个好人 让爱传递
Or you could just be nice -- pay it forward.

218
00:07:14,641 --> 00:07:16,110
别老是给他们灌输不良思想
They don't make movies out of bad ideas.

219
00:07:16,119 --> 00:07:17,839
我只知道你们要努力争夺自己想要的东西
All I know is you got to fight for what you want.

220
00:07:17,849 --> 00:07:19,348
要是只有一个就业岗位
If there's one job available,

221
00:07:19,348 --> 00:07:20,736
而你们不去争取 就会像那样被人夺走
this guy just got it,

222
00:07:20,736 --> 00:07:22,445
你们就在"傻菲"家等着挨饿吧
and they go hungry at the "Dumphys'".

223
00:07:22,486 --> 00:07:24,929
是"邓菲"啦
"Dunphys'".

224
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:28,100
我还是搞不懂 她干吗要咬人
Okay, I don't get it. Why is she biting?

225
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,840
莉莉 你干吗要咬人
Lily, why are you biting?

226
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,480
她才不是咬人呢 她这是在磨牙
She's not biting. She's teething.

227
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,220
在人身上磨牙
On people!

228
00:07:32,452 --> 00:07:34,434
好了 要是她再这样继续咬她的玩伴
All right, if she starts biting her play dates,

229
00:07:34,434 --> 00:07:35,791
她就会被人唾弃的
she's gonna be a pariah.

230
00:07:35,791 --> 00:07:36,928
"食人鲳"也挺可爱的
Try "piranha".

231
00:07:36,928 --> 00:07:37,551
你要这样称呼咱们的女儿吗 小卡
Really, cam?

232
00:07:37,551 --> 00:07:38,869
一时口快
It was right there.

233
00:07:38,899 --> 00:07:41,102
好吧 你也该知道我绝对
All right, you should also know that I in no way --

234
00:07:41,504 --> 00:07:43,666
一点儿都没怪你
in no way -- blame you.

235
00:07:43,696 --> 00:07:45,979
-那多谢了 你为啥要怪我 -我没有
- Well, thank you. Why would you blame me? - I don't.

236
00:07:46,009 --> 00:07:47,660
好啊 因为我就没怪你
Well, good, because I don't blame you.

237
00:07:47,689 --> 00:07:49,449
明显得很
Well, obviously.

238
00:07:49,449 --> 00:07:51,742
我觉得你又在怪我了
Uh, okay, well, now I'm starting to feel the blame.

239
00:07:51,742 --> 00:07:53,914
没 我没有 好吧 是因为
No. No. Don't -- it's...

240
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,520
整天都是你跟她在一起 你该教好她的
it's just that you're with her all day.

241
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,960
现在我有一个咬人的女儿和一个叮(激怒)人的老公
I have a daughter who bites and a partner who stings.

242
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,180
好吧 你想知道真相吗
Okay. Okay, you want to know the truth?

243
00:08:02,352 --> 00:08:05,138
你有时候会给她一些奇怪的暗示
Sometimes you've sent her some mixed signals.

244
00:08:05,138 --> 00:08:06,717
我要咬你的小脚丫
I'm gonna bite your feet!

245
00:08:06,737 --> 00:08:08,819
我要把它们咬掉
I'm gonna bite 'em right off!

246
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:14,600
哦 我可没有把牙齿当瑞士军刀来用
Oh, I'm not the one who uses my teeth like a multi-tool.

247
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:17,180
好了 莉莉的饼干
Here we go. Cookies for Lily...

248
00:08:18,022 --> 00:08:19,953
我们的酒
...and wine for us.

249
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:21,840
好吧
Okay.

250
00:08:21,914 --> 00:08:23,553
我不敢相信你居然拿
I can't believe you would equate --

251
00:08:23,563 --> 00:08:24,951
别把我的头咬掉了
Oh, don't bite my head off.

252
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:26,380
我可不是电池
I'm not a pack of batteries.

253
00:08:27,636 --> 00:08:30,211
往这边移一点 这就对了
Un poquito mas aca. Es perfecto all.

254
00:08:30,241 --> 00:08:31,691
很好 棒极了
Ay, good. Bellissimo.

255
00:08:33,812 --> 00:08:35,240
这里怎么有个盒子
Why is this box here?!

256
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,789
实在抱歉 是我们放的
I am sorry -- we did,

257
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,086
因为我们要搬桌子
because we were moving the tables.

258
00:08:38,086 --> 00:08:40,037
那你为啥要搬桌子
Well, why are you moving the tables?

259
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,980
这样孩子们就有更大的空间跳舞了
So the kids have more space to dance.

260
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,100
这样更好
It's better this way.

261
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:45,180
真的吗 歌洛莉亚
Is it really, Gloria?

262
00:08:45,220 --> 00:08:46,920
因为现在这里看起来就是
Because right now it kind of just looks like

263
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:49,580
一堆桌子和一大片空地
a clump of tables and a big open space.

264
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,120
听着 我很抱歉
Look, I'm sorry,

265
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,280
但是我们以前就这么做的
but we've always done it this way,

266
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,800
我认为如果你把桌子搬来搬去
and I think it's gonna throw people off

267
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,720
会把人们吓跑的
if you move them around.

268
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:58,660
天啊 这些桌子看上去真不错
Oh, my god, these tables look great!

269
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,160
谁弄的
Who did this?

270
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:00,980
是我耶
I did!

271
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:02,140
爱死了
I love it!

272
00:09:02,475 --> 00:09:04,105
你好啊
Hello.

273
00:09:04,114 --> 00:09:05,814
咱们还没自我介绍呢
We haven't been properly introduced.

274
00:09:05,834 --> 00:09:07,091
-我叫歌洛莉亚 -我叫贝瑟妮
- I'm Gloria. - I'm Bethenny.

275
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,880
不知是否有人跟你说过
I don't know if anybody's ever told you this,

276
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:11,320
你很漂亮
but you're really pretty.

277
00:09:11,949 --> 00:09:14,352
不 不 贝瑟妮 没人跟她这么说过
No. No, Bethenny. No one's ever told her that.

278
00:09:14,372 --> 00:09:16,404
这些桌子真超乎
I am seriously freaking out

279
00:09:16,580 --> 00:09:17,700
我的想象
about these tables!

280
00:09:17,842 --> 00:09:19,441
这样好了 我们在要放桌子的地方
You know what? Let's just put a pin in

281
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:20,500
做个记号
where we're gonna put the tables.

282
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,980
好啊 桌子就这样放
Yes, we're keeping the tables!

283
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,420
还有什么需要我帮忙么
So what else can I do?

284
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,840
你可以
Um...you can...

285
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,200
帮我拿一下凳子
help me with the chairs.

286
00:09:27,380 --> 00:09:27,680
好吧
Okay.

287
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,000
我们需要很多凳子
We need a lot of them.

288
00:09:29,237 --> 00:09:31,591
凳子就放在台下 就在这儿
They're under the stage right...here.

289
00:09:31,601 --> 00:09:32,648
请吧
There you go.

290
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:35,320
这里还真是又黑又脏的说
It's like dirty and dark there, no?

291
00:09:35,460 --> 00:09:37,160
我知道 不太爽是吧
Yeah, I know. Bummer, right?

292
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,640
进去吧
Off you go.

293
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,640
味道有点怪啊 克莱尔
Smells funny, Claire!

294
00:09:42,382 --> 00:09:43,972
对不住了 继续往里爬
So sorry. Keep goin'!

295
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:47,400
又咋了嘛
What?

296
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:49,320
我们真的需要凳子
We needed chairs.

297
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,540
你们讲啥呢
What are you guys talking about?

298
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,080
没啥 他说
No, nothing. He was just saying

299
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,980
他爱死这些桌子了
how much he loves the tables.

300
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:12,060
要是我有收据
If I had the receipt,

301
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:14,020
我就用不着叫你查了
I wouldn't need you to look it up.

302
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:17,120
照这样下去 第一轮舞我是跳不成了
At this rate, I'm going to miss the first dance...

303
00:10:17,420 --> 00:10:18,400
我说的是我以后的婚礼
at my wedding!

304
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:20,840
他不是说他只有一件东西要买单吗
I thought he only had one item.

305
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,300
跟你老爹说去 要是当初听我的
Tell your dad, if it were up to me,

306
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:24,140
我们十分钟之内就可以买完走人了
we'd have been in and out of here in about 10 minutes.

307
00:10:24,753 --> 00:10:25,810
你说过了
You mentioned that.

308
00:10:25,829 --> 00:10:26,724
我可能还会再说一次
And I'll probably mention it again,

309
00:10:26,724 --> 00:10:27,650
因为托某人的福
because, thanks to someone,

310
00:10:27,650 --> 00:10:28,676
我们还得继续耗在这儿
we're gonna be here for a while.

311
00:10:28,676 --> 00:10:29,631
好吧 我懂了
Yeah, I get it.

312
00:10:29,631 --> 00:10:32,004
知道吗 卢克 你应该买套大号的西服
You know, Luke, you should order that suit in a larger size,

313
00:10:32,015 --> 00:10:33,795
因为等我们结账走人的时候[卢克该长大了] -我懂了
- because by the time we get out of here - I...get...it.

314
00:10:33,815 --> 00:10:35,043
这是西装钱
Pay for the suit.

315
00:10:35,052 --> 00:10:36,169
你这是要去哪
Where the hell are you going?

316
00:10:36,198 --> 00:10:37,928
卢克还需要 袜子
Luke needs...socks.

317
00:10:37,938 --> 00:10:39,336
要青色的
Make 'em teal!

318
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:41,040
你是承心惹我哈
You're playing a very dangerous game.

319
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:42,920
嘿 筒子们
Hey, boys...

320
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,140
看看谁来了
look who it is --

321
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:46,000
那个占了我们停车位的家伙
the guy that stole our parking spot.

322
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:49,273
-你要去扁他么 -是我的话就肯定扁他
- Are you going to hit him? - I'd totally hit him.

323
00:10:49,283 --> 00:10:50,481
我不会扁他
I'm not gonna hit him,

324
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:51,687
但我要跟他讲道理
but I'm gonna give him a piece of my mind.

325
00:10:51,687 --> 00:10:53,265
筒子们 注意了 要想当爷们儿
Now, boys, pay attention -- you want to be men,

326
00:10:53,265 --> 00:10:55,378
就得学我这样对付这些痞子
this is how you handle a jerk like this.

327
00:10:55,388 --> 00:10:57,761
嘿 兄弟
Hey, chief?

328
00:10:57,771 --> 00:11:00,125
你今天抢了我们的停车位
You know, you stole our parking space today.

329
00:11:00,155 --> 00:11:01,935
-啥 -就是这么回事
- What? - That's right.

330
00:11:01,965 --> 00:11:03,113
我正在等停车位
I was waiting for the parking space,

331
00:11:03,142 --> 00:11:04,169
你溜过去就把位给占了
You sneaked right in there --

332
00:11:04,188 --> 00:11:05,345
你以为你爸李刚啊
that make you feel like a big man?

333
00:11:05,354 --> 00:11:07,225
有吗 我根本没注意到
Did I? I didn't even notice.

334
00:11:07,607 --> 00:11:08,825
这借口没啥说服力
That's no excuse.

335
00:11:08,854 --> 00:11:10,815
我真的很抱歉
I'm really sorry.

336
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:12,265
我的狗今天死了
My dog died today.

337
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,800
我不得不给他安乐死
I had to put him to sleep.

338
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,220
十四年了
14 years,

339
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:17,780
我们俩相依为命
he was all I had.

340
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,800
现在我每每想起回家
Now I can't stand the thought

341
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,280
就独守空巢 眼泪就哗哗的
of going back to my empty apartment,

342
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:23,460
所以我就不停地跑商场来晃悠
So I just keep wandering around the mall.

343
00:11:23,580 --> 00:11:26,020
这样好了 忘了
You know what? Forget about the...

344
00:11:26,334 --> 00:11:27,562
停车位[也指"圆点"]的事吧
spot.

345
00:11:27,581 --> 00:11:29,111
天啊
Oh, god!

346
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,302
他名字就是圆点
That was his name!

347
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,960
请不要扁他
Do not hit him.

348
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,200
喷点男士香水
Oasis for men?

349
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,020
有意思
That's funny.

350
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,580
你好像是在问我
You made that sound like a question,

351
00:11:48,450 --> 00:11:49,707
却又不给我机会回答
then you didn't wait for me to answer.

352
00:11:49,727 --> 00:11:50,653
-什么 -让哥教教你
- What? - Here, let me show you.

353
00:11:50,662 --> 00:11:51,739
看 你是这么说的
Yeah, yeah, yeah. You go --

354
00:11:51,758 --> 00:11:54,072
你说 喷点 男士香水
You go, "Oasis for men"?

355
00:11:54,092 --> 00:11:56,526
懂不 你说了 喷点 男士香水
You see what I mean? You went, "Oasis for men"?

356
00:11:56,536 --> 00:11:57,541
你应该说 要喷点男士香水吗
You should have said, "Oasis for men"?

357
00:11:57,541 --> 00:11:58,437
然后我回答 给哥来两下
Then I'd go, "Yeah, give me two".

358
00:11:58,437 --> 00:12:00,418
但是你说 喷点 男士香水
But instead, you went, "Oasis for men".

359
00:12:00,428 --> 00:12:01,957
-好吧 -你滴明白
- Okay. I get it. - You see what I mean?

360
00:12:01,957 --> 00:12:03,465
-明白了 -我看未必
- I-I get it. I get it. - No, I'm not sure you do!

361
00:12:03,465 --> 00:12:04,813
你没说完“男士香水”就喷我
You sprayed before "Men"!

362
