You're not pathetic.

546
00:19:39,560 --> 00:19:41,400
好吧 是有点令人难过
Okay, that's a little bit sad.

547
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,520
我们喜欢自认为聪明
We like to think we're so smart

548
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:47,860
自认为自己能解决一切问题
and we have all the answers.

549
00:19:48,740 --> 00:19:51,340
而且我们希望可以把这些传授给孩子们
And we want to pass all that on to our children.

550
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:52,920
但是
But...

551
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:54,600
如果你不只停留在肤浅的表面上的话
if you scratch beneath the surface,

552
00:19:54,700 --> 00:19:57,000
用不着深究就能看到你自己儿时的样子
you don't have to dig very deep to find the kid you were.

553
00:19:57,620 --> 00:19:58,840
这也正是疯狂的地方
Which is why it's kind of crazy

554
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:00,520
现在我们自己都有孩子了
that now we're raising kids of our own.

555
00:20:01,939 --> 00:20:03,770
你知道吗 这是一个里程碑
You know what? This is a milestone.

556
00:20:03,780 --> 00:20:06,334
我们接受我们的小天使并不是那么完美
We're accepting that our little angel isn't perfect.

557
00:20:06,364 --> 00:20:08,838
是的 这没关系
That's right. And it's okay.

558
00:20:10,508 --> 00:20:12,178
我 我收回刚才的话
I-I take it back --

559
00:20:12,187 --> 00:20:13,436
她很完美
she is perfect.

560
00:20:13,445 --> 00:20:16,251
但是我猜这才是生命真正的轮回
But I guess that's the real circle of life.

561
00:20:16,271 --> 00:20:18,805
你父母这样长大
Your parents faked their way through it,

562
00:20:18,815 --> 00:20:20,897
你也这样长大
you fake your way through it,

563
00:20:20,917 --> 00:20:22,466
那么 我希望
and, hopefully,

564
00:20:22,466 --> 00:20:24,538
你没有养了一个连环杀人犯
you don't raise a serial killer.

565
00:20:30,592 --> 00:20:32,433
这不好笑
That's not funny.

566
00:20:33,117 --> 00:20:35,359
我感到很抱歉
I am so sorry.

567
00:20:35,359 --> 00:20:37,763
不 把所有事都抛在脑后
No,just come over watching movie

568
00:20:37,763 --> 00:20:38,960
过来看电影吧
put the whole thing behind you.

569
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,067
好的 一会见
Okay, see you in a bit.

570
00:20:40,076 --> 00:20:42,359
是浪琴 他现在心情很差
That was Longines. He's in a very bad place.

571
00:20:42,379 --> 00:20:43,908
不是吧 怎么了
Oh, no. What happened?

572
00:20:43,908 --> 00:20:46,292
有个疯子在商场发飙了
Well, apparently some maniac went crazy at the mall

573
00:20:46,302 --> 00:20:48,062
用男士香水袭击了他
and attacked him with oasis for men.

574
00:20:48,112 --> 00:20:50,184
好吧 我想我们都知道早晚会有这么一天
Oh. Well, I think we all knew that day was coming.

575
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,573
好吧 祝我好运
All right. Wish me luck.

576
00:20:53,583 --> 00:20:55,162
祝你好运
Good luck.

577
00:20:55,182 --> 00:20:57,294
好了 亲爱的
Okay, honey.

578
00:20:57,304 --> 00:20:59,396
拜托不要咬老爸
Please don't hurt daddy.

579
00:20:59,426 --> 00:21:01,186
好了
All right.

580
00:21:01,186 --> 00:21:02,916
来 张嘴
"Ahh".
